Rem Temperature, base kelvin - the only quantity here with an offset, and
Rem the reason a bare multiplying factor is not enough. A temperature
Rem DIFFERENCE converts by Factor alone and must not go through these.
Let unitKelvin = EngUnit("KELVIN", "TEMPERATURE", 1, 0)

Def EngKelvin() As EngUnit
